<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1384496793"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1468053532"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="That’s Why"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ILLENIUM / Josh Golden"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ASCEND"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:12.913"><div begin="00:13.574" end="03:52.195"><p begin="00:13.574" end="00:16.822" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Flame still burns<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烈焰熊燃</span></p><p begin="00:17.073" end="00:20.156" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Kerosene</p><p begin="00:20.429" end="00:23.806" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Rise and fall, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烟霭涌翻 随呼吸袭来</span></p><p begin="00:24.041" end="00:26.904" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">As I breathe</p><p begin="00:26.904" end="00:28.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">All these pictures on the screen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">荧幕前的画板</span></p><p begin="00:28.953" end="00:30.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">It's almost like they're real<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛若真实的存在</span></p><p begin="00:30.568" end="00:33.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">And I think that I'd do anything if it meant I didn't feel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想着我该去竭尽所能</span></p><p begin="00:33.811" end="00:34.848" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">What I feel</p><p begin="00:35.743" end="00:37.641" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">And I feel way too much<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是我藻饰太多</span></p><p begin="00:37.641" end="00:40.122" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Truth is no one gives a fuck<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真相 从不被人理睬</span></p><p begin="00:40.227" end="00:41.959" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我不会再来</span></p><p begin="00:43.591" end="00:46.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">I don't try</p><p begin="00:47.045" end="00:49.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我只愿俯瞰</span></p><p begin="00:50.409" end="00:54.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">I stay high</p><p begin="00:54.759" end="00:57.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I know that you're never gonna hear me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白 你再也不会听我哪怕一言一语</span></p><p begin="00:58.194" end="01:00.802" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">I know that these words'll go to waste<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白 苦心经营的词句只会白白浪费</span></p><p begin="01:00.802" end="01:02.404" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我不会再来</span></p><p begin="01:04.202" end="01:08.586" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">I don't try, yeah</p><p begin="01:14.495" end="01:16.143" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就是原因</span></p><p begin="01:20.911" end="01:23.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Why</p><p begin="01:22.133" end="01:25.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Tried my best<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竭尽全力 门却仍紧关</span></p><p begin="01:25.598" end="01:28.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Doors still closed</p><p begin="01:29.033" end="01:32.205" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Love is deaf<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只知道爱 是无声枉然</span></p><p begin="01:32.205" end="01:35.605" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">For all I know</p><p begin="01:35.621" end="01:38.912" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Sometimes it gets so hard, and I don't wanna fight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时会步履艰难</span></p><p begin="01:39.088" end="01:42.381" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">And every day that passes by feels like it might<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走过的每一天</span></p><p begin="01:42.381" end="01:43.549" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Be my last</p><p begin="01:44.249" end="01:46.182" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">And I feel way too much<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深有同感</span></p><p begin="01:46.182" end="01:48.698" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Truth is no one gives a fuck<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真相 从不被人理睬</span></p><p begin="01:48.751" end="01:50.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我不会再来</span></p><p begin="01:52.152" end="01:55.384" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I don't try</p><p begin="01:55.602" end="01:57.568" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我只愿俯瞰</span></p><p begin="01:59.019" end="02:02.518" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">I stay high</p><p begin="02:03.345" end="02:06.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">I know that you're never gonna hear me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白 你再也不会听我哪怕一言一语</span></p><p begin="02:06.729" end="02:09.367" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">I know that these words'll go to waste<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白 苦心经营的词句只会白白浪费</span></p><p begin="02:09.367" end="02:10.999" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我不会再来</span></p><p begin="02:12.783" end="02:17.284" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">I don't try, yeah</p><p begin="02:29.957" end="02:31.589" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我不会再来</span></p><p begin="02:33.345" end="02:36.478" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">I don't try</p><p begin="02:36.729" end="02:38.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我只愿俯瞰</span></p><p begin="02:40.161" end="02:43.529" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">I stay high</p><p begin="02:57.304" end="02:59.037" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我不会再来</span></p><p begin="03:00.762" end="03:03.946" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">I don't try</p><p begin="03:04.180" end="03:06.096" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我只愿俯瞰</span></p><p begin="03:07.562" end="03:11.096" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">I stay high</p><p begin="03:11.861" end="03:14.728" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">I know that you're never gonna hear me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白 你再也不会听我哪怕一言一语</span></p><p begin="03:15.264" end="03:17.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">I know that these words'll go to waste<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白 苦心经营的词句只会白白浪费</span></p><p begin="03:17.962" end="03:19.594" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我不会再来</span></p><p begin="03:21.261" end="03:25.845" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">I don't try, yeah</p><p begin="03:38.477" end="03:40.077" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我不会再来</span></p><p begin="03:41.861" end="03:45.011" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">I don't try</p><p begin="03:45.277" end="03:46.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">That's why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我只愿俯瞰</span></p><p begin="03:48.709" end="03:52.195" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">I stay high</p></div></body></tt>